4 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#F4F1EA]">Attention to Detail</h3><p class="sm:col-span-6 text-sm md:text-[15px] text-[#B8C0D0] leading-relaxed">From kerning and color harmony to frame-accurate cuts, we obsess over the subtle refinements that separate amateur work from luxury.</p></div><div class="py-7 md:py-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-3 sm:gap-6 items-baseline" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="sm:col-span-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-[#DFC48B] tabular-nums">04.</span><h3 class="sm:col-span-4 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#F4F1EA]">Accessible &amp; Affordable</h3><p class="sm:col-span-6 text-sm md:text-[15px] text-[#B8C0D0] leading-relaxed">Founded as a lean, zero-budget studio, we bring international-agency polish within reach of startups, creators, and small businesses.</p></div><div class="py-7 md:py-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-3 sm:gap-6 items-baseline" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="sm:col-span-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-[#DFC48B] tabular-nums">05.</span><h3 class="sm:col-span-4 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#F4F1EA]">Personalised Collaboration</h3><p class="sm:col-span-6 text-sm md:text-[15px] text-[#B8C0D0] leading-relaxed">You work directly with the creative mind behind the craftâ€”transparent communication, iterative refinement, and zero agency bureaucracy.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#080F22] border-t border-[#DFC48B]/10"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6"><p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.24em] uppercase text-[#DFC48B]">05 Â· Contact Us</p><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-[#F4F1EA] leading-[1.12]" style="text-wrap: balance;">Let's shape your <span class="italic gold-gradient-text">next identity.</span></h2><p class="text-sm md:text